# Deny repo internals; new site pages and assets remain deployable by default.
# Gitignore patterns: https://vercel.com/docs/deployments/vercel-ignore
/*.md
# Markdown notes are internal at every depth.
*.md
/PLAN*
/docs
/tests
/tools
/.github
/.git
/.gitignore
/.vercel
/.vercelignore

# Unreferenced design preview; keep all other assets and vercel.json.
/assets/favicon-preview.png
